<p>Allows shields to be equipped, using Cunning instead of strength as a requirement.</p><p>When you are attacked in melee, you have a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">18%, 20%, 21%, 23%, 24%</acronym> chance to deflect the attack with your shield, completely evading it.</p><p>In addition, as long as you are wearing armour no heavier than leather, you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 6, 9, 11, 13</acronym> Armour and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 14%, 18%, 21%, 23%</acronym> Armour hardiness.</p><p>The chance to deflect increases with your Cunning.</p>